msgid ""
"\n"
"PyTeXMK-支持使用魔法注释来定义待编译主文件、编译程序、编译结果存放位置等（仅支持检索文档前 50 行）\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"PyTeXMK - supports using magic comments to define the main file to compile, compiler, output directory, etc. (only searches the first 50 lines of the document)\n"

msgid "[i]LaTeX 辅助编译程序  ---- 焱铭[/]"
msgstr "[i]LaTeX auxiliary compiler  ---- Yanming[/]"

msgid ""
"如欲了解魔法注释以及其他详细说明信息请运行 -r 参数，阅读 README 文件。发现 BUG 请及时更新到最新版本，欢迎在 Github "
"仓库中提交 Issue：https://github.com/YanMing-lxb/PyTeXMK/issues"
msgstr ""
"To learn about magic comments and other detailed information, run with the -r option to read the README file. If you find a bug, please update to the latest version promptly. "
"Feel free to submit an issue on the GitHub repository: https://github.com/YanMing-lxb/PyTeXMK/issues"

msgid "显示 PyTeXMK 的版本号并退出"
msgstr "Show PyTeXMK version number and exit"

msgid "显示 PyTeXMK 的帮助信息并退出"
msgstr "Show PyTeXMK help information and exit"

msgid "显示README文件"
msgstr "Show the README file"

msgid "PdfLaTeX 进行编译"
msgstr "Compile with PdfLaTeX"

msgid "XeLaTeX 进行编译"
msgstr "Compile with XeLaTeX"

msgid "LuaLaTeX 进行编译"
msgstr "Compile with LuaLaTeX"

msgid "使用 LaTeXDiff 进行编译, 生成改动对比文件，当在配置文件中配置相关参数时可省略 'OLD_FILE' 和 'NEW_FILE'"
msgstr "Compile using LaTeXDiff, generate a change comparison file. 'OLD_FILE' and 'NEW_FILE' can be omitted when the corresponding parameters are configured in the config file"

msgid ""
"使用 LaTeXDiff 进行编译, 生成改动对比文件并编译新文件，当在配置文件中配置相关参数时可省略 'OLD_FILE' 和 "
"'NEW_FILE'"
msgstr ""
"Compile using LaTeXDiff, generate a change comparison file and compile the new file. 'OLD_FILE' and 'NEW_FILE' can be omitted when the corresponding parameters are configured in the config file"

msgid "启用草稿模式进行编译，提高编译速度 (无图显示)"
msgstr "Enable draft mode for compilation, improves compilation speed (no graphics displayed)"

msgid "清除所有主文件的辅助文件"
msgstr "Clean auxiliary files of all main files"

msgid "清除所有主文件的辅助文件（包含根目录）和输出文件"
msgstr "Clean auxiliary files (including root directory) and output files of all main files"

msgid "清除所有带辅助文件后缀的文件"
msgstr "Clean all files with auxiliary file extensions"

msgid "清除所有带辅助文件后缀的文件（包含根目录）和主文件输出文件"
msgstr "Clean all files with auxiliary file extensions (including root directory) and main file output files"

msgid "非安静模式运行, 此模式下终端显示日志信息"
msgstr "Run in non-quiet mode, terminal displays log information in this mode"

msgid "显示 PyTeXMK 运行过程中的详细信息"
msgstr "Show detailed information during PyTeXMK execution"

msgid ""
"尝试修复所有根目录以外的 PDF 文件, 当 LaTeX 编译过程中警告 invalid X X R object 时, 可使用此参数尝试修复所有"
" pdf 文件"
msgstr ""
"Attempt to repair all PDF files outside the root directory. When LaTeX compilation warns about invalid X X R object, "
"use this option to attempt repairing all pdf files"

msgid ""
"尝试编译结束后调用 Web 浏览器或者本地 PDF 阅读器预览生成的PDF文件 (如需指定在命令行中指定待编译主文件, 则 -pv 命令, 需放置"
" document 后面并无需指定参数, 示例: pytexmk main -pv; 如无需在命令行中指定待编译主文件, 则直接输入 -pv "
"即可, 示例: pytexmk -pv), 如有填写 [dark_cyan]FILE_NAME[/dark_cyan] 则不进行编译打开指定文件 "
"(注意仅支持输出目录下的 PDF 文件, 示例: pytexmk -pv main)"
msgstr ""
"Attempt to open the generated PDF file in a web browser or local PDF viewer after compilation finishes. "
"(If you specify the main file on the command line, the -pv option must be placed after the document name and requires no arguments, example: pytexmk main -pv; "
"if you do not need to specify the main file on the command line, simply enter -pv, example: pytexmk -pv). "
"If [dark_cyan]FILE_NAME[/dark_cyan] is provided, the specified file is opened without compilation "
"(note: only supports PDF files in the output directory, example: pytexmk -pv main)"

msgid "待编译主文件名"
msgstr "Main file name to compile"
